WEBVTT

00:03:26.595 --> 00:03:30.630
Living in two completely different
worlds at the same time,

00:03:31.983 --> 00:03:36.086
and all the hiding and pretending
that went with it,

00:03:37.088 --> 00:03:38.239
it was --

00:03:38.263 --> 00:03:39.510
it was exhausting,

00:03:39.534 --> 00:03:41.620
and made me feel very alone.

00:03:43.937 --> 00:03:46.784
Over time, I worked
through those struggles

00:03:46.808 --> 00:03:48.446
and I gained the confidence

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:52.583
and the acceptance to bring
my whole self to work.

00:03:52.607 --> 00:03:54.956
And as a direct result of that,

00:03:56.194 --> 00:03:57.877
I found joy again in it.

00:03:58.202 --> 00:04:00.706
During that hard journey back to work,